<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for Meshy.app and its bundled CLIs (Developer ID builds).
  Meshy is not sandboxed, so outgoing network (WKWebView, URLSession), spawning the
  bundled meshy/meshyd/meshy-mesh and calling launchctl need no entitlement. WKWebView's
  JIT runs in WebKit's own processes. Add an exception here only when something breaks.
-->
